{%- comment -%}
  The ring loader — a band drawn full circle, then its stone struck above it.
  Same engine as the diamond: every line is one path with `pathLength="100"`,
  class `loader__line`, an inline `--n` for its place in the draw and an
  `--exit` naming which layer it leaves with. The viewBox keeps the diamond's
  96×84 proportions so `.loader__mark`'s aspect-ratio serves both.
{%- endcomment -%}
